    239: { question: "What has an abyssal trench deeper than the highest mountain is tall?", answer: "trench", hints: ["A long, steep-sided depression in the ocean floor.", "The crushing pressure here creates a completely alien environment.", "The Mariana region features the deepest example of this feature."] },
