    242: { question: "I am the swirling whirlpool that sucks unwary galleons down into the dark. What am I?", answer: "whirlpool", hints: ["A powerful, rotating body of water produced by colliding tides.", "It forms a spinning vortex capable of pulling ships under.", "Sailors navigate wide berths to avoid its deadly center."] },
