    248: { question: "I am the cold, black brine of the deep ocean floor. What am I?", answer: "brine", hints: ["Water heavily saturated with dissolved salt in deep basins.", "It forms underwater lakes that do not mix with normal seawater.", "Dive submersibles must navigate its dense, hypersaline layers."] },
    249: { question: "What has a drowned kingdom waiting for a hero to raise it from the depths?", answer: "realm", hints: ["A royal kingdom lost beneath the surface of the sea.", "Ancient legends say it can be restored by a worthy champion.", "Its gates remain sealed behind walls of coral and stone."] },
    250: { question: "The sunken kingdom is explored. Name the scientific study of the ocean depths and marine life.", answer: "oceanography", hints: ["The interdisciplinary science exploring marine ecosystems and currents.", "Researchers use sonar and submersibles to advance this field.", "It uncovers the hidden secrets of the world's deep waters."] },

