    275: { question: "The mystic marshes are crossed. Name the ecological wetland term for a treeless peat-accumulating area.", answer: "bog", hints: ["Think of the standard scientific name for an acidic, peat-producing wetland.", "It serves as the ultimate descriptor for this type of terrain.", "The answer begins with \"B\" and has 3 letters."] },
    
